            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/nfarina/brushy/releases/tag/v0.2.4</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Marquee: a W × H readout in pixels follows the pointer while you drag out a rectangle, as in Photoshop.
- Marquee, lasso and magic wand: the options bar shows the selection's size in pixels, next to the canvas size.
]]></description>
