        <item>
            <title>0.2.3</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:50:47 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://nfarina.github.io/brushy</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/nfarina/brushy/releases/tag/v0.2.3</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Layer thumbnails: ⌘⇧-click adds a layer's pixels to the selection, ⌘⌥-click subtracts them, and ⌘⇧⌥-click intersects, keeping soft edges. ⌘-click still selects them.
- Marquee, lasso and magic wand: ⇧⌥ now intersects with the selection.
- Selection cursors show a +, − or × badge for add, subtract and intersect, on the canvas and over a layer thumbnail while ⌘ is held.
- View ▸ Show Selection Edges (⇧⌘H) hides or shows the selection's marching ants.
- Marquee: a ⇧ or ⌥ you're already holding when you click only picks add or subtract. Release and press it again mid-drag to square or centre the rectangle, as in Photoshop.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/nfarina/brushy/releases/download/v0.2.3/Brushy-macos.zip" length="5749589" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="K3dBCAFjveparu9ulgCzKBQ3PGquPeDHTngVhmrP72ijyA1aGa7vimzbKaeqzDcaIilFG5CKjYDeGvH8Atv+CQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.2.2</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 13:44:10 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://nfarina.github.io/brushy</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/nfarina/brushy/releases/tag/v0.2.2</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Brushy now appears in Finder's Open With menu for PNG, JPEG, GIF, TIFF, HEIC, WebP, AVIF, BMP and JPEG XL images, and accepts images dropped on its Dock icon. Each opens as a new document with the image as its only layer.
- Image Size: typing into the width or height field no longer changes the number as you type.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/nfarina/brushy/releases/download/v0.2.2/Brushy-macos.zip" length="5736207" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Myhi/AL3FA5GJvuVT/yE5iEhTtXnpkcghnpjmxKJZsPO+crYNd3miz45YOEgnIIev/vfF+Pjg3I5XxEfhyu/AQ=="/>
